OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'fearful' for their
OL,4,Ahomes amid fireworks trouble
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in west Belfast were
OL,7,F"fearful" that their homes would be
OL,8,Fburned down by a group of young people
OL,9,Fthrowing fireworks on Saturday night, a
OL,10,Flocal councillor has said.
OL,12,FPeople in the area said a group of
OL,13,Fabout 30 youths were involved in the
OL,14,Ftrouble.
OL,16,FBelfast City Councillor Paul Doherty
OL,17,Fsaid someone could be seriously hurt,
OL,18,For potentially, lose their life.
OL,20,FA resident added that it was a "regular
OL,21,Foccurrence" and residents were
OL,22,F"tortured".
